Programs and services Studio talks to but does not include
----------------------------------------------------------

ComfyUI: GPL-3.0. Workers run it as a separate program; Studio and the worker
  pool reach it over HTTP.
SageAttention: Apache-2.0. An optional attention kernel on worker machines.
FFmpeg: LGPL-2.1-or-later or GPL, depending on the build. Studio runs it as a
  separate program; the container image installs Debian's ffmpeg package.
Outbound GPU worker pool (Boundless-Studios/outbound-gpu-worker-pool): MIT.
Freesound: each sound keeps the licence Freesound reports for it (CC0 by
  default; CC-BY only when an audio set opts in). Audio releases record every
  sound's licence and credit in their CREDITS.md.
Higgsfield: generation sent to Higgsfield uses the caller's own key and runs
  under Higgsfield's terms.

Python and JavaScript dependencies keep their own licences; see
pyproject.toml, uv.lock, mcp/pyproject.toml and web/package-lock.json.


